<title>巴拿马上皮塔洛萨地区附近北京时间10日1:56:06 发生7.7级地震，震源深度12.6千米。网传视频显示，佩诺诺梅和索</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35671</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35671</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:28:06 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>巴拿马上皮塔洛萨地区附近北京时间10日1:56:06 发生7.7级地震，震源深度12.6千米。<br/>网传视频显示，佩诺诺梅和索纳两地似乎有建筑物倒塌，其中一段画面显示一名男子朝废墟呼喊，寻找是否有被困人员。截至目前尚未有人员伤亡报告。<br/>巴拿马教育部宣布取消全国学校当天剩余课程。<br/>托库门国际机场一度停运，航班改道至其他机场，之后于晚些时候恢复运营。<br/>国家自来水和污水处理局报告称，由于地震造成的停电，多家水处理厂的运行受到影响。<br/>（<a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us6000u18k/executive" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美国地质调查局</a>，<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c620r39zdp9wo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">BBC</a>，<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/10/09/americas/panama-earthquake-latam-intl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">CNN</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/eEAIvHeX7Z4ylIQagfgVGfSSxw6_upBcUuZHQaC8awb7ZQOzeoNSrVDCxJBiS3IiFsKOBpQFPOMhed0SvbYpWqyez-HKNeN2tDymifrtke6X733SA5WGxdrruoGy_AX_3YCBnWc--FrVgPppyvlJNiES6VPsbgmeb0kJRgDQMfqEWBXpk2YLbAd0yCyPs-0TA7FF1zdn_1f1KNhgocnMbZv80lxdlhGAAWHA9TbArdQ6LtC_wCJwhInfbz_d1RqLDS6PbszHIDHtjxTj5FDDDyEN07xsx5iezAsUKVzzdll9ArhpbvjZxanR3c0opSVmuaDYLZbajPnNxfLYZVbxbg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
